# Tenantry's analyzers (docs/analyzers.md), configured for what this sample shows on purpose.
[Program.cs]
# Any caller picks a tenant with a header, a subdomain or a cookie, to keep the sample to what Native AOT supports. An
# application validates the caller's access to the tenant, as Tenantry.Samples.SecureApi does.
dotnet_diagnostic.TNY2001.severity = none
